; Y hot dry-run step-loss characterization generated by generate_y_step_loss_test_gcode.py
; Source motif: TB6600 housing first-layer contour/travel near the observed Y offset failure
; This file heats like PETG-CF, moves near the bed, and emits no extrusion moves.
; Endstop verification key: stepper_y
; Z characterization height: 0.770
; Bed temperature: 80
; Nozzle temperature: 265
; Y endstop: -14.800
; Y high-stress anchor target: -9.800
; Stress profiles: hammer_hot_dry
; Cycles per profile: 20
; Total endstop checks: 20
M117 Y hot dry-run characterization
RESPOND TYPE=echo MSG="Y hot dry-run characterization: heating bed to 80C and nozzle to 265C, then running 20 near-bed checks with no extrusion."
M140 S80
M104 S265 T0
T0
G90
M400
G28 X Y Z
M400
M190 S80
M109 S265
G1 Z0.770 F600
M400
RESPOND TYPE=echo MSG="Y hot dry-run profile hammer_hot_dry: velocity 400 mm/s, accel 6000 mm/s^2, SCV 10, 20 cycles."
; Check 1/20: profile=hammer_hot_dry velocity=400 accel=6000 scv=10 cycle=1
SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT VELOCITY=350 ACCEL=1000 SQUARE_CORNER_VELOCITY=5
G1 X59.232 Y81.585 Z0.770 F21000
M400
